WEBVTT

00:03:57.917 --> 00:04:03.434
Can we create online marketplaces
that are convenient and abundant

00:04:03.458 --> 00:04:04.708
and human?

00:04:05.458 --> 00:04:08.250
The good news is that the answer is yes.

00:04:08.958 --> 00:04:12.018
Companies in emerging
markets around the world,

00:04:12.042 --> 00:04:14.809
in China, India and Southeast Asia,

00:04:14.833 --> 00:04:17.059
are doing just this,

00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:21.333
using a model that I call
conversational commerce.

00:04:21.958 --> 00:04:23.851
It's hard to believe, isn't it?

00:04:23.875 --> 00:04:26.208
But let me give you a few examples.

00:04:27.042 --> 00:04:28.726
First: Meesho,

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:34.684
an Indian company where you can build
a trusted and authentic relationship